[38;2;124;124;124mA manifold is parallelizable if its tangent bundle is trivial, i.e., there exist[0m[38;2;124;124;124mn everywhere-linearly-independent vector fields (where n is the dimension).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mA non-vanishing vector field exists iff the Euler characteristic χ(M) = 0 (for [0m
